---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoEffSumEvolutionDemo from '../demos/GoEffSumEvolutionDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="geff-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Sum() Case Study Simulator: Sum1 to Sharded 8 KB Workers" titleVi="Mô phỏng tối ưu hàm Sum(): Từ Sum1 tới 8 KB Streaming & Sharded Workers">
    <GoEffSumEvolutionDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Walk through Bartłomiej Płotka's Sum() optimization ladder using live Apple M2 Go 1.27 measurements: cutting bytes.Split, eliminating string copies, streaming with 216 B heap, and dodging channel contention.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đi từng bước theo bài toán Sum() với số đo thật trên Apple M2 Go 1.27: bỏ bytes.Split, dẹp copy chuỗi, streaming bằng 216 byte heap và tránh nghẽn channel.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .geff-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .geff-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .geff-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .geff .sd-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); }
  .geff .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .geff .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .geff .sd-stat b { font-size: 16px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }

  .geff-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .geff-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .geff-pane { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .geff-hdr {
    padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .geff-code { padding: 8px 0; overflow-x: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .geff-line { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 2px 12px; white-space: pre; color: var(--text-body); }
  .geff-ln { color: var(--text-muted); user-select: none; min-width: 18px; }
  .geff-bars { padding: 12px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body); }
  .geff-bar-row { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .geff-bar-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12.5px; margin-bottom: 4px; color: var(--text-body); }
  .geff-track { height: 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--bg-alt); border: 1px solid var(--border); overflow: hidden; }
  .geff-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--text-muted); transition: width 0.2s ease; }
  .geff-fill.is-ok { background: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .geff-fill.is-ok { background: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .geff-fill.is-bad { background: var(--red); }
  .geff-verdict { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
